/T (Background This project focuses on analyzing customer behavior based on e-commerce platform serving both B2B and B2C customers.  The project is based on two years worth of companies raw customer data \(22.2.2023-21.2.2025\) and the goal was to transform the raw data into actionable business insights and actions. )
